  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7b56a8729645f274f94070be076fe0e7, type: 3}
  m_Name: Note_Shipwreck
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NoteName: Shipwreck Note
  NoteHeader: Crewmate's Diary (1/3)
  NoteText: "Our boat was wiped out by a huge storm, and ever since me and my crew
    have been lost in this endless ocean.\nAll sense of the world I knew is gone,
    whilst my crewmates think we can escape, I\u2019m not so sure..\n\r\nEvery day
    I see something new that I can't comprehend.. Just today, there was a giant eye
    surrounded by mountains that seemed to be.. watching us.. and the fish we found
    there were covered in eyes..\n\r\nRight now, escape feels impossible. But, I'm
    sure with the whole crew here, we'll figure out a way to get home..\r\n"
